{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_32","type":"agent_message","text":"The direct GEMM loses on medium and large matrices, so the vendor path stays there. For the two tiny matrices, however, a single fused RMSNorm+GEMM kernel is clearly faster and locally matches bit-for-bit; I’m adding that narrow size-based tile choice and validating it."}}
